{"chapter":{"blocks":[{"text":"第7章 电报与继电器","type":"TITLE"},{"text":"本节学习：第7章 电报与继电器。讲义保留原有示例与练习，可结合正文向教师提问。","type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"text":"电报网用继电器自动转发信号。继电器本身就是个电磁开关，可以被电控制来控制其他电路——这是**逻辑门**的硬件基础。","type":"MARKDOWN"}],"grade_max":12,"grade_min":10,"knowledge_points":[{"description":"学习并解释「第7章 电报与继电器」中的核心概念与示例。","name":"第7章 电报与继电器","slug":"senior-coding-topic-07","topic":"计算机与人工智能"}],"license_code":"UNKNOWN","objectives":["解释「第7章 电报与继电器」的主要概念，并结合示例完成文中练习。"],"order_index":14,"revision":1,"slug":"ch-007-main","source":{"conversion":"supplied-markdown-v1","original_sha256":"515db4e64643c3600e27b843640814df894f10549ca7fb6dc0e66aca13683ed6","source_commit":null,"source_path":"sources/515db4e64643c360/07-编码.md"},"stage":"SENIOR","title":"第7章 电报与继电器"},"content_hash":"623c8a7b081ae64339c053e203146f52454f5dd9c4567829d520faca5da27f81","course":{"slug":"senior-coding","title":"编码与计算机系统","topic":"计算机与人工智能"},"is_test_fixture":false,"manifest_hash":"b2500e5121455aa9339fe6399902e89a0917eaf9bd814708a6dc69af397b6b20","release_key":"computing-ai-md-v1-db6ffb6b663b","schema_version":"k12.content.revision-snapshot.v1","source_kind":"NEW_SOURCE"}
